  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be a vector parallel to the line of intersection of the planes&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>. The plane <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is parallel to the vectors&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> while plane <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is parallel to the vectors&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. The acute angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is"
  },
